Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:22.17,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's set sail before the break of dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:26.67,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}to meet a yet unseen tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:30.31,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I've made up my mind, and I have no regrets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:37.05,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No matter what trials wait for us along the way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:41.69,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}nothing can ever stop the pounding of our hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.82,0:00:46.36,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There is but one place we all aim for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:52.00,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The bonds that we gained at the end of the battle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:55.67,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will not let anyone damage them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:58.47,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If we open our clenched fists
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:01.71,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we'll find strength within them
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:04.11,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:09.28,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}A brand new world is calling for us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.65,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Look ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:18.02,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Even if countless seas stand between us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.09,0:01:21.79,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we're always supporting each other
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:25.46,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's move on without any fears
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:27.83,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Please don't forget
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:37.11,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The great, wide, distant sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:39.88,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}that we looked up to on that day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:45.02,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}has yet to be tainted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.05,0:01:48.45,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We've come quite a long way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.39,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}all carrying the vows we made within our hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:54.99,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There's nothing to fear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:59.40,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We all have burdens we must carry
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.57,0:02:01.87,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The sun rises
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:06.84,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}and it brightens everything, even my sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.24,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:15.68,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}in the future where we'll come together as one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:19.28,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go find it together
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:23.09,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There's nobody that can take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:25.22,OP14 Translation,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Please don't forget

